  "mcpDecision": "Extend existing native/MCP storage facts with a complete bounded audit of every local use before publishing or caching registrations. Existing allocation/slot locations group source sites while callback/registration locations distinguish independent action declarations. This helps agents trace multiple constructor registrations without claiming that callbacks are simultaneously active or knowing which UI handler dispatches. Reuse shared storage/consumer, initial attachment and source action analyzers, value snapshots, freshness/cancellation/project isolation, exact export, response limits and read-only host. No new tool, argument, schema or response member is required. Tool descriptions and client documentation describe the expanded semantics.",
